        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We provide 100% declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, covering loss, theft, or damage during transit. The policy includes a simple claim filing process, real‑time claim status updates, and coverage up to the full market value of your items, giving you peace of mind throughout the relocation.</p>
      </div>
