        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are the packers and movers in Madinaduda IBA approved and ISO certified?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, our company holds IBA mover code approval and ISO 9001:2015 certification. These credentials confirm adherence to industry‑wide standards for safety, quality management, and ethical practices, ensuring that every relocation is handled with professionalism and accountability.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost matrix for a move from Madinaduda to a major transport hub calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost matrix considers distance (≈850 km), vehicle type, load volume, packing material, insurance, and any special services such as stair‑case handling or white‑glove delivery. Transparent line‑item pricing lets you see exactly where each charge originates, helping you choose the most cost‑effective option.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for GST billing when hiring packers and movers in Madinaduda?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For GST‑compliant billing, you need a valid GSTIN, a detailed invoice outlining services, vehicle numbers, and e‑Way bill numbers. Our team prepares all paperwork, ensuring it meets Central and State government reimbursement guidelines, making it simple for corporate or personal claim submissions.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment in real time during the Madinaduda‑to‑Hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every truck is equipped with satellite GPS, and you receive a secure link to monitor location, estimated arrival, and any checkpoint updates. Real‑time tracking enhances security and allows you to coordinate receiving arrangements at the destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes the 7‑layer protective packaging system superior for fragile items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer system combines high‑density bubble wrap, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, foam edge protectors, stretch film, and custom wooden crates. Each layer targets specific shock, vibration, and moisture risks, ensuring delicate items like glassware, electronics, or temple statues arrive intact, even on long highway hauls.</p>
